Package: MineralMappeR
Type: Package
Title: Mapping Hydrothermal Alteration Zones in Porphyry Systems using Landsat 9
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Theano Skolariki <theano.skolariki@outlook.com>
Maintainer: Theano Skolariki <theano.skolariki@outlook.com>
Description: A specialized toolkit for the identification of diagnostic mineral
    indices in porphyry-style hydrothermal alteration systems. Utilizing
    Landsat 9 multispectral data, the package provides functions for
    high-reflectance masking, vegetation filtering (NDVI), and the
    calculation of diagnostic ratios for iron oxides and hydroxyl-bearing
    minerals (argillic and phyllitic zones).
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    terra,
    ggplot2,
    tidyterra,
    ggspatial
URL: https://github.com/theniaskolariki/MineralMappeR
BugReports: https://github.com/theniaskolariki/MineralMappeR/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
